# Dependencies
node_modules
node_modules/

# npm lockfile - the project uses Bun, so package-lock.json would go stale.
#
# The Bun lockfile is the opposite case and is deliberately not ignored:
# bun.lock at the repository root is committed and is the dependency pin for
# the whole workspace (sites/world is a workspace member, so there is no
# second lockfile). CI installs with --frozen-lockfile against it, so two
# builds of the same commit install the same dependency versions. Do not add
# it to this file.
package-lock.json

